  "question": "Combine the pre-task requirement state with the current client task. If the task determines a unique post-task state, choose ACT and construct that state; otherwise choose CLARIFY and identify the blocking requirement field and the question that must be answered.",
  "target_task": {
    "source_message_id": 35,
    "speaker": "client",
    "text": "Here's an offer: submit this as the first audio audit, and we'll check it. We'll also recheck the text with the &quot;use ai&quot; service. If both the text and the audit are okay, we'll cancel the refund."
  },
  "history_pool": {
    "boundary": "STRICTLY_BEFORE_TARGET_MESSAGE",
    "contains_target_message": false,
    "message_count": 34,
    "messages": [
      {
        "message_id": 1,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The voiceover will be sent next Friday afternoon.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 2,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Alright then",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 3,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Hello, I'm sending over both the voiceover and the preferred voiceover audit feedback. Thank you.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 4,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Any news ?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 5,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "It's in progress and should be ready shortly.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 6,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Thank you! Could you confirm that you saw the files? I'm checking because there have been times when people didn't receive an upwork notification.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 7,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "This is for you, Feld.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 8,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "What's happening here? I don't quite understand it =)",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 9,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The middle part is intended for comments.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 10,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The current state points to a complete revision. It now appears that the entire thing has to be changed.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 11,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "This is filled with a story rather than an audio audit—did you simply send it to AI?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 12,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Instead of an audio audit, the result is a story on a different theme in English. You simply gave the task to AI, and it failed to understand your prompt. Good job.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 13,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Hi there, Marcus.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 14,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I'm waiting for a response after sending this feedback to my Danish specialist.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 15,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I can see that you've already ended the contract, but could you possibly let me correct this within 10 hours??",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 16,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Sorry, but if this was done via AI, even though the task requires listening and marking errors, and the text audit was handled the same way, we can't risk this project. We're not prepared to take another chance. Thank you.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 17,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Marcus, give me 10 hours and I'll sort it out!!",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 18,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "As we said, we're in a rush with this one, and we've found a new auditor. Will we also have to pay for services that check whether text was made with AI?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 19,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "That's understandable, Marcus. Alright then.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 20,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "For the initial revision, though, I'd argue that some compensation is in order.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 21,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Your position makes sense to me, but the job wasn't done and I can't use what an ai produced. Because of that, I have to start over.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 22,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Marcus, I personally handled the initial revision.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 23,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "The initial revision wasn't made with AI.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 24,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "If you have a Danish specialist on your side, how could you have handled it yourself?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 25,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Proofreading made up most of the initial revision, and that's my field.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 26,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Are you saying you can prepare the text for a correct voiceover, yet you can't check the resulting voiceover?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 27,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Unlike the earlier proofreading task, today's work involved voice revision, and I have a network of content specialists I work with.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 28,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "We'll have to begin again because this is too complicated and we can't use the text.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 29,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Marcus, is the voice revision really the only setback here? This doesn't need to be complicated, right??",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 30,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Restarting isn't necessary; I can assure you that the proofreading is 100% accurate.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 31,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "No. Since the voiceover was made using AI, I think the audit was created the same way, so I can't use it. I'll have to pay full price and start all over again.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 32,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Marcus, I completely understand. The initial revision is 100% accurate, I assure you. If you can give me an additional 10 hours, I'll get the voice revision sorted out; I've already contacted my other specialist, and she's available now, waiting for my go-ahead.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 33,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "That's totally fine if you say you can't work with it.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 34,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Could we agree on some compensation for the initial revision? I'd really appreciate it.",
        "milestone": null
      }
    ]
  },
